From b8a2c6b1cb0138bacd22a0b518868e88442baea2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Li Guan <guanli.oerv@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 00:23:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Isolate legacy script fixtures and exercise module access
 offline

Reset the process-wide accessibility flag for each script and restore it
afterwards. Test daemon assignment on an unstarted thread, join the workers
that assert inner-class behavior and send harness diagnostics through the
interpreter directly. Check package access separately from nested class
construction, retaining the original access assertions.

Read from a local jar: URL to exercise a real, non-exported JDK connection
implementation without an external server. Include the failed assertion
in each script report and emit individual JUnit XML results.

Upstream: downstream Ant and JDK test environment integration
Reference: https://github.com/beanshell/beanshell/tree/2.1.1/tests
Signed-off-by: Li Guan <guanli.oerv@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
